$$SYNTAX-LEVEL 2
*(coming-soon {include-css: /css/data_center.css}
<div style="padding:5px">
  <h2>Coming soon to MaizeGDB</h2>
  Updated September 28th, 2021
  <br><br>
  
  <h3>Tracks</h3>
  <ul style="margin-left:20px">
    <li>
      <s><i>Ab initio</i> gene models for v5 and NAM assemblies</s>  
      <span class="notice">- completed</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <s>TE annotations</s> <span class="notice">- completed</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <s>Structural Variations</s>
      <span class="notice">- completed (based on B73v5 coordinates\)</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <s>Align SNPs from MaizeSNP50 chip</s>
      <span class="notice">- completed</span>
      </li>
    <li>Core Bin Markers 
        <span class="notice">- available on browsers, but not yet elsewhere</span></li>
    <li>HapMap5 &rarr; replaced with WGS mapping, in progress</li>
    <li><s>B73v5 methylome</s>
      <span class="notice">- completed</span></li>
    <li>HiC data</li>
  </ul>
  <br>
  
  <h3>Page updates</h3>
  <ul style="margin-left:20px">
    <li>Core Bin Marker Pages</li>
    <li>
      <s>Additional functional annotations for NAM gene models</s> 
      <span class="notice">- completed</span>
    </li>
    <li><s>JBrowse snapshots within gene model pages</s> 
        <span class="notice">- completed</span></li>
    <li>
      <s>Pan-gene information on gene pages</s> <span class="notice">- completed</span>
    </li>
    <li>Add physical coordinates for each NAM line to NAM genetic map page</li>
  </ul>
  <br>
    
  <h3>Tools</h3>
  <ul style="margin-left:20px">
    <li>MaizeMine update to include v5 annotations</li>
    <li>
      <s>qTeller update to include NAM RNA-seq data</s>
      <span class="notice">- completed</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <br>
  
  <h3>Features</h3>
  <ul style="margin-left:20px">
    <li>
      <s>Pan-genome and syntenic ortholog information</s>  <span class="notice">- completed</span>
    </li>
    <li>External links to Apollo instances for manual structural annotations</li>
    <li>
      <s>V5 gene models linked to gene data</s>  <span class="notice">- completed</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <s>Current v5 gene models are evidence-based. <i>Ab initio</i> gene models 
        will be added when available.</s>  <span class="notice">- completed</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      Create JBrowse instances for non-NAM assemblies
      <span class="notice">- done for W22 and Mo17 CAU</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <s>Deploy JBrowse plugins to combine bigWig tracks</s>
      <span class="notice">- completed</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <br>
</div>
)
